    <briefdescription>
<para>Declares the Advanced Sector Protection (ASP) interface of the SFL. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This file defines the ASP XSfl_AspVendorOps vendor dispatch table of the serial flash library (SFL). It also declares the vendor-neutral XSfl_Flash* ASP APIs. The implementations are in <ref refid="xilsfl__asp_8c" kindref="compound">xilsfl_asp.c</ref>.</para><para><preformatted>
